<title>USA: Optical Sensors extended sensor cleared.</title>
<headline>Optical Sensors extended sensor cleared.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optical Sensors Inc said Tuesday the U.S. Food and Drug Administration gave it clearance for the company to market its Extended Life SensiCath Sensor.</p>
<p>The device was cleared for expanded use of 144 hours from 72 hours and to 200 arterial blood gas measurements from 100.</p>
<p>Optical Sensors' patient-attached, on-demand arterial blood gas monitoring system provides on-demand arterial blood gas within 60 seconds.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
